      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa1516750f50.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa1516fa4221.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b5f03389.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b5f24f7e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b5f7db71.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b5fcebd1.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b5fda1be.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b5feb152.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b601a569.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b602d097.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b603a5f0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b6079350.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b60e0713.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94b60e5824.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94bca7987e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94bcae870c.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94bcb0d457.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94bcb91a14.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94bcbce22f.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94be8d3d34.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94cff1368a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94cff290bd.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94cff2d5e4.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aa94dca8a9bc.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6aaf1817553db.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69ce672252.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69ce782473.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69cf31ed0a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69cf50a3dc.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d0193c5a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d04b2eab.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d08bbf2e.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d0eeb2e9.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d0f7b366.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d113013b.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d1386e77.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d1617989.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab69d16d277d.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6ab6a0d62212a.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; v1.0.0 Release&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;v1.0.0 Release&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;Support&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you like my mods and want to buy me a coffee:&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://xn--kofi-m86a.com/kento1911" target="_blank"&gt;https://ko‑fi.com/kento1911&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;Support is completely optional, all mods remain &lt;b&gt;100% free&lt;/b&gt;.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;&lt;b&gt;Introduction&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;I've always wanted a mod that lets Guardians help Link fight enemies, but I couldn't figure out how to make it work — I tried many times without success. Over the past two years, while researching Tears of the Kingdom, I came across some interesting mechanics and started looking into Breath of the Wild again, but still couldn't find the answer. Then, in mid-2026, I happened to test some parameters — and it actually worked. My dream finally came true, and the answer turned out to be surprisingly simple.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Version Support&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/715476"&gt;Wii U: v1.5.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/716804"&gt;Switch: v1.6.0, 1.9.0&lt;/a&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Core Feature&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;Guardians ignore Link and actively hunt down all enemies across Hyrule.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Affected Units&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod works only for Stalker, Skywatcher, Turret, and Decayed Guardians. Guardian Scouts can be targeted by the above‑mentioned Guardians.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Amiibo Spawning&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;The Guardian Amiibo spawns only Guardian Stalkers, normally one at a time.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Since the amiibo cannot be used in many situations, spawning via a save editor or other mod‑spawning tools is recommended.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Tip&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;Whistling makes Guardians turn toward Link, helping clear nearby enemies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Combat Rules&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Guardian attacks can still damage Link, and Guardians can also damage each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. If Link accidentally damages a Guardian, it retaliates one single time, then drop aggro.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Dormant Guardians fire once upon detecting Link.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. Urbosa's Fury still works against Guardians.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h2&gt;Enemy Behavior toward Guardians&lt;/h2&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. Main‑story bosses, Yiga Clan members, Hinoxes, and Molduga only target Link and do not fight Guardians.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. Regular enemies (Bokoblins, Moblins, Lizalfos, Lynels, Chuchus, Octoroks, Wizzrobes, Pebblits, Keeses) attack Guardians, but their attacks lack collision and damage registration against Guardians.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. Taluses can fight Guardians with fully functional damage exchange.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;4. Wolf Link has infinite HP and ignores Guardians, and is ignored by them.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Optional Install Toggles&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;1. **Guardian Civil War**&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Guardian Stalkers, Skywatchers, Turrets, and Decayed Guardians attack each other.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;2. **Regular Enemies Ignore Link**&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Regular enemies listed above do not target Link, guardians still hunt and engage these enemies.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;*Sandbox observation feature — not intended for regular gameplay.*&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;3. **Guardian Civil War + Regular Enemies Ignore Link**&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Enables both above‑listed behaviors.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;h1&gt;Additional Notes&lt;/h1&gt;&lt;br&gt;This mod does not alter Guardians colors. The ancient orange tint on Guardian Stalkers is a Graphics Pack effect. Skywatchers and Turrets already feature native ancient orange coloration in the base game.</description>
