      <guid isPermaLink="false">b08a0a9dd72f2be1c71e4fa4fbc579ca3fd5d505</guid>
      <pubDate>Sun, 06 Sep 2026 00:26:09 +0000</pubDate>
      <description>&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a8420ef62fe0.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a841b8c275eb.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a841b8c27629.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a841b8c2a2a2.jpg"/&gt;&lt;img src="https://images.gamebanana.com/img/ss/mods/6a841b8c2b499.jpg"/&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;strong&gt;Update:&lt;/strong&gt; Cooked Foods&lt;br&gt;&lt;p&gt;This update &lt;strong&gt;&lt;em&gt;did not&lt;/em&gt;&lt;/strong&gt; take a month, actually more like a day and a half in total. I've been so incredibly busy that I just now managed to sit down and finish it, and after losing everything &lt;strong&gt;twice&lt;/strong&gt; because I'm a fucking idiot, I deliver upon thee.&lt;/p&gt;&lt;p&gt;With this, this mod is officially on par with the inspiration, and from now on it'll be bigger than the original.&lt;br&gt;Let me know what you think! I have to choose whether to continue with vanilla or make a version for Second Wind first...&lt;/p&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: Changed descriptions for every cooked meal.&lt;br&gt;&lt;em&gt;Addition&lt;/em&gt;: Changed descriptions for every roasted/frozen material.&lt;br&gt;&lt;hr&gt;&lt;br&gt;Hola.&lt;br&gt;This mod is inspired by the mod &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/33476"&gt;Linkle's Personalized Item Descriptions&lt;/a&gt;.&lt;br&gt;The reason I started this mod was mainly to make it line up with &lt;a href="https://gamebanana.com/mods/439900"&gt;The Legend of Linkle Dialogue Mod&lt;/a&gt;, but I ended up just including like three or four mentions of that and ended up doing my own thing, so that's why this mod has the name it has, and so I present to you:&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;b&gt;Alternative Linkle's Personalized Descriptions.&lt;/b&gt;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;It changes the descriptions of some items to make it seem as if Linkle wrote them herself, giving her a personality of sorts. It's based on the premise of the Legend of Linkle mod, so it might be weird at times without it.&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;It varies from the inspiration in the sense that the personality I gave Linkle isn't as bubbly and quirky as the original, but still very likeable and a bit of a pyromaniac, or at least I hope so.&lt;br&gt;I am &lt;i&gt;&lt;span class="RedColor"&gt;not&lt;/span&gt;&lt;/i&gt; a writer, and this is my first time having to impersonate someone for &lt;i&gt;&lt;b&gt;so&lt;/b&gt;&lt;/i&gt; long.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;If you don't like it, I'm so sorry! I'm tired.&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;I'm open to suggestions, feedback, and possible changes to accommodate other mods. I also plan on making a version for Second Wind, so uh, stay tuned!&amp;nbsp;&lt;br&gt;&lt;br&gt;Enjoy, and I don't know, give it a like or something.&lt;br&gt;&lt;img src="https://media1.tenor.com/m/92MplgQwb80AAAAC/cat-meme-wave-emoji.gif" alt="a close up of a cat holding a pixel art object ."&gt;&lt;br&gt;</description>
      <media:content url="https://files.gamebanana.com/mods/alternativelinklespersonalizeddescriptions.bnp" type="application/octet-stream"/>
